{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

## Releasing

Push a tag such as `v1.2.3`. The version is derived from the tag; CI
{%- if is_gitlab %}
{%- if is_library %} publishes the package to the GitLab package registry and
{%- else %} pushes the Docker image to the GitLab container registry and
{%- endif %} creates a GitLab release with notes generated from the commit history.
{%- else %}
{%- if not is_library %} pushes the Docker image to the GitHub container registry (ghcr.io) and
{%- endif %} creates a GitHub release with notes generated from the commit history
{%- if is_library %}, with the wheel and sdist attached.

To also publish to PyPI, add this repository (workflow `ci.yml`, environment
`pypi`) as a trusted publisher on PyPI and set the repository variable
`PYPI_PUBLISH` to `true`.
{%- else %}.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

